    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="Prol. 2">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIEm">II Em</ref> Prol. 2</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Me egleð swyðe ⁊ us eallum þa unrihtlican ⁊ mænigfealdan gefeoht ðe betwux us sylfum syndun; ðonne cwæde we:</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">I myself and all of us are greatly distressed by the manifold illegal deeds of violence which are in our midst. We have therefore decreed:</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Me eleð swyðe ⁊ us eallum ða unrihtlican ⁊ mænigfealdan gefeoht, ðe betwux us sylfum syndan; þonne cwæde we:</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
